  "description": "T13 bilateral CLI observation (expected match), item 17 of the versioned inventory (contract L13/assertion 35): spawn_session with an unknown provider override fails BEFORE any spawn — zero upstream requests, zero sub-session registry rows created. Deterministic and race-free: the tripwire check (client pool resolution) happens synchronously ahead of core.spawn() in both implementations, so there is nothing timing-dependent to observe here at all — the entire scenario is a single parent round trip.",
